Subject: [PATCH 016/110] Fix promptless polecat startup and nudge targeting
 (#3574)

* fix(tmux): canonicalize stored pane ids for nudge

* fix(polecat): deliver full startup prompt for codex fallback

* test(cmd): fix compact report helper signature

---------

Co-authored-by: mayor <chriskane@Chriss-MacBook-Air.local>
